    "body": "> In [the Open UI explainer](https://open-ui.org/components/popover-hint.research.explainer/#:~:text=A%20popover%3Dauto%20can%20never%20be%20nested%20inside%20a%20popover%3Dhint%2E), it says that\n> \n> > A `popover=auto` can never be nested inside a `popover=hint`.\n\nI can’t seem to find an explanation in the explainer to why that restriction is there. Are there situations where this would make things very complicated? If not, perhaps a 4th option is “remove the restriction”?",
