    "body": "I was thinking of the use-case Jake mentioned at the end of [the OP](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12346#issue-4226015284): a customizable select _(which uses a `popover=auto` for the picker)_ inside a `popover=hint`.\n\nBut like Jake said, one could argue that one shouldn’t be building it that way.",
