    "created_at": "2026-04-09T09:16:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-09T09:16:32Z",
    "body": "> [@keithamus](https://github.com/keithamus) so are you saying the downgrade to hint would happen without any kind of console warning? I guess it would be weird to warn about `<select>` when there isn't much the developer can do about it.\n\nI think we can still `console.warn`.\n\n> @mfreed7 is there any benefit to taking this to Open UI?\n\nI think we can likely resolve this here. Not averse to raising it in OpenUI though.",
